@startuml autonomous-service-value-stream-boundary
title Autonomous Service vs Autonomous Value Stream Boundary
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Autonomous Value Stream" as avs
class "Autonomous Service" as autosvc

avs --> autosvc : uses (one or more)

note right of avs
  End-to-end autonomous
  value realization
end note

note right of autosvc
  Service-level autonomous
  realization
end note

note bottom
  Autonomous Service does NOT
  establish autonomy across the
  entire Value Stream
  per ADR-ES-015 §13
  per ASVC-AUTO-NEG-005
  per ASVC-AUTO-NEG-014
end note
@enduml
